/*
 * URLFrameClass entrypoint and sole class owner. The class/interface is in
 * htmlview.goh; external methods are registered here in their original order.
 * This core coordinates frame state, content cleanup, cache-page attachment,
 * document notifications, graphics loading and security integration.
 *
 * The remaining responsibilities are organized by concern:
 *   URLFrameTree.goc       - Frame/view creation, frameset restoration and
 *                            collection, frame attributes and traversal.
 *   URLFrameNavigation.goc - Link targets, URL completion, fetch initiation,
 *                            reload/save/source requests and refresh timers.
 *   URLFrameScript.goc     - Script contexts, events and private state.
 *   URLFrameTimers.goc     - Script timeout and interval timer management.
 *   URLFrameFetch.goc      - Fetch/cache requests, external files, parsing
 *                            callbacks, errors and fetch acknowledgements.
 *   URLFramePage.goc       - Received-page metadata, presentation, embedded
 *                            audio and completion.
 *   URLFrameGeometry.goc   - Frame dimensions and UI geometry/focus updates.
 *
 * Source boundaries do not create code resources. Tree/navigation and Watcom
 * script methods share URLFRAME_TEXT. Preserve the legacy Borland script
 * switch below: it also affects this core's later CLEAR_OBJ_CACHE handler.
 */

/**************************************************************************
 *        Include files
 **************************************************************************/

